{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國賓夕法尼亞州一所高中近日決定停用一套採用人工智能技術的武器探測系統。儘管該系統已經在學校進行了數月的數據收集和訓練，卻始終無法可靠地區分槍支與學生日常攜帶的普通物品，頻繁發出錯誤警報。校方最終認為，這套設備尚未達到實際投入使用的標準。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586956.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.334273+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:09:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_hash":"a89abd6d8b0237e27cbf875b747e69c64995cf3d3bc6ece5513042d46347453d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}